WEBVTT

00:06:00.288 --> 00:06:04.121
So it can be something as
simple as, you know,

00:06:04.121 --> 00:06:06.829
certain kinds of action sequences
don't work right now.

00:06:07.079 --> 00:06:09.413
Does it really matter about like,
you know,

00:06:09.413 --> 00:06:12.038
a certain kind of car chases work
or don't work in movies?

00:06:12.079 --> 00:06:18.079
Probably not really. Doesn't matter when
we decide, as the industry had for years,

00:06:18.079 --> 00:06:20.954
that female driven action movies
don't work commercially.

00:06:21.288 --> 00:06:25.204
And the consequences of that we see
in our gender relationships,

00:06:25.204 --> 00:06:28.121
in our daily lives when people assume, oh,
well,

00:06:28.121 --> 00:06:31.704
you can't sell black actors
abroad outside of the US,